contentText:
Maná will light up stadiums across Latin America later this year as they return to the region during their Vivir Sin Aire Tour.

The announcement came on Thursday (June 11), just hours before their historic performance at the opening ceremony of the 2026 FIFA World Cup at Mexico City&#8217;s Estadio Azteca, which organizers said was watched by billions of viewers worldwide.

